---
title: "keepAlive (stem-bot-v2: src/utils/keepalive.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: performKeepAlive() initial call
    q_init --> q_schedule: setInterval(performKeepAlive, 6 hours)
    q_schedule --> q_wait: interval running

    q_wait --> q_query: timer fires
    q_query --> q_success: supabase.from(teams).select count
    q_query --> q_error: query failed
    q_success --> q_wait: logger.info(count)
    q_error --> q_wait: logger.error(error)

    note right of q_query
        INV-001: Keep-alive runs indefinitely with no circuit breaker
        INV-002: Uses teams table for heartbeat (couples health check to data schema)
    end note
